      "en": "“Shouldn’t the multitude of words be answered? Should a man full of talk be justified?",
      "ko": "말이 많으니 어찌 대답이 없으랴 입이 부푼 사람이 어찌 의롭다 함을 얻겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "f8bdd51047b4024bfa30cdbf873792130d61a890bdb9cdabee72a515e5327fbb",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8602054526f2f08e14fdda22189d360d3c7f035a80f8c16401724053daf494c",
