      "en": "But oh that God would speak, and open his lips against you,",
      "ko": "하나님은 말씀을 내시며 너를 향하여 입을 여시고",
      "source_text_hash": "6cd0e180c9cb0c86579c2af6b262ac8e7b89c0447e0c32d34a1df1bb3d2e48df",
      "translation_text_hash": "9a057241d80051bb083cb1045d3e2be6d099e561199ef1442fc02ef51d14091a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님은 말씀을 내시며 너를 향하여 입을 여시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9a057241d80051bb083cb1045d3e2be6d099e561199ef1442fc02ef51d14091a"
      ]
    },
    {
