      "en": "“Can you fathom the mystery of God? Or can you probe the limits of the Almighty?",
      "ko": "네가 하나님의 오묘를 어찌 능히 측량하며 전능자를 어찌 능히 온전히 알겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "7ab8fcbd6e8ec683a273038862555c1ab4f390418890de49335d789fcbb12ce0",
      "translation_text_hash": "816a9b2f3e4ca6a930b093eeb36b93e5b922f0c9f3743560713561ec50cbc31b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
